{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a very short (10-15 minutes long) kinetic visual novel, set in the &quot;<i>Welcome To... Chichester</i>&quot; semi-realistic world of secret organisations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066290/extras/3019051846d4e86dcff2f5a6361bc33c.avif?t=1762635778\" width=1024 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chuck Sterling is Manchester, New Hampshire's most popular late-night chat show host, as well as being a TV presenter, newsreader, compere and possible<i> Council</i>\u00a0operative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight, on his chat show, &quot;<i>Manchester Report</i>&quot;, coming live from the &quot;<i>Wendel Minx Broadcasting Center&quot;,</i> Chuck will be interviewing local entrepreneur <i>Abigail Harrera</i> and well known radio personality<i> Grendel Jinx</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066290/extras/f6d7e0b3151d0d21830fa7f60b8b928d.webp?t=1762635778\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 - 15 minutes long.\u00a0 Excellent for those with short attention spans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced (Nate_S - Chuck Sterling;\u00a0Vandraho - Abigail Herrera and Lauren Pak (and Alice J) as Grendel Jinx)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start A New Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066290/788396eb91759e17202a5af05fc4273c0456419e.jpg"},{"name":"Monologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st